            <section><h2 class="text-xl font-bold">Cancel before preparation</h2><p class="mt-2">You can request cancellation while a store order is pending or confirmed. Open your order page, choose the store order, and send a cancellation request. JMMart reviews the request; the order is cancelled only when an admin approves it. Once preparation or delivery begins, use the order help option instead.</p></section>
